build: 2026-06-22 v10.39.0 (Sound fixes + Automation + MIDI drum import + Audio Clips + Unison)
branch: claude/piano-roll-clip-view-wozlie
includes: SOUND FIXES (komische Töne): three root causes of intermittent weird tones are fixed. (1) STUCK SUB DRONE — the felt sub's note-off could be skipped when the bio pattern evolved and the bass register shifted, leaving a wrong-pitch sub droning under the new chord; the sub now tracks the LOWEST sounding note each tick (stateful, symmetric) so it can never strand and always reinforces the true root. (2) OFF-PITCH SUB — the octave-down sub was hard-clamped to 28–180 Hz, forcing an off-key frequency on higher bass notes; it now octave-FOLDS into the felt band, keeping the pitch in tune, and drops the clashing 3rd-harmonic fifth + heavy saturation for a clean, felt sub (still audible on small speakers via the octave). (3) SLIDING NOTES — when polyphony exceeded the voice count, a stolen voice glided ~16 ms into the new pitch (audible portamento); new notes now snap to pitch (no click — phases/amplitude still glide). DSP-audited. AUTOMATION (new): Tools ▸ Editors ▸ Automation — keyframe lanes that ride the transport and shape Master Level or Tempo over the loop (Beat · Value · Curve rows; Linear/Hold). MIDI DRUM IMPORT (new): "Import MIDI" now also fills the beat grid from General-MIDI channel-10 drums (Kick/Snare/Hats/Clap, with toms/cymbals → Perc), so one import brings both melody and drums. AUDIO CLIPS: Tools ▸ Audio & Bio ▸ Audio Clip — import any audio file (WAV/AIFF/MP3/M4A/…) and play it as a CLIP with trim/loop/gain (attached additively to the master mix). MIDI IMPORT (melody): SMF Type 0/1 → piano roll, folded onto the bar. UNISON: per-sound stacked detuned voices (Tools ▸ Editors ▸ Sound ▸ Unison) for a thick ensemble; gentle default on Bright/Vapor leads, pads/keys stay clean; off is bit-identical, decode-safe for old patches. Builds on v10.37.1 (per-channel insert FX + Channel Rack). All Xcode-Compile-Check green per commit; audio-thread + concurrency + DSP reviews on the touched paths. Still honestly held for a dedicated cycle: automation song-position (absolute-bar) + automation to DSP params + multi-track parallel-lane arrangement + video capture/edit.
